      "comment": "CALAIS (2) makes his first outing and has drawn to advantage. Watch the betting closely for a strong push. TALK TO TIGER (7) has been freshened since missing the frame on debut at Gunnedah over 340m (20.54). Expected to do much better this time. BUZZ BULLET (1) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 6 lengths into third (17.71) at Taree Super Track in a Maiden over 300m. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Will give a great sight again. FEDERAL FRED (8) is a newcomer from the Leeanne Goodwin kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Betting to provide the best guide to his chances.",
